# =====================================================================
# Release V070 -- Short Notice Cancellation: date-based
# =====================================================================
# Dim_Cancellation_Reasons.Is_Short_Notice is empty on real Dentally data (the
# cancellation-reason map is mock-seeded), so Short Notice Cancellation Rate read 0%.
# Redefine in the daily aggregate: short notice = cancelled within @Short_Notice_Days
# of the appointment (Cancelled_At vs appointment date). On dev T100: ~24% at <=1 day.
#
# NOTE: this re-deploys the daily aggregate SP, so it also carries the V065 chair-
# utilisation block fix (same file). Rebuild the aggregate (+ Fact_Metric_Actuals +
# model) after deploy.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V070__short_notice_date_based.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Aggregate_Site_Patient_Practitioner_Daily.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
